# FS04 reproduction: open the C:\ window (Alt+C), pick up C:\README.TXT and
# drop it on the D: DRIVE ICON on the desktop -- i.e. copy a small text file
# from one partition to another, the gesture in the ticket.
# Click points from the probe run (method/fs04-probe.actions):
#   desktop icons  C (38,35)  D (129,35)  E (220,35)  F (311,35)
#   C:\ window     README.TXT (179,271)
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 key 38
1550 key 2e
1600 key ae
1650 key b8
3000 mark B_WIN
3300 move 179 271
3900 down
4400 drag 179 200
4900 drag 160 120
5400 drag 132 45
5900 drag 129 35
6400 up
# the COPY FILE(S) confirmation comes up; OK is at (233,301).  The clock
# restarts the instant form_do returns, so the user's reading time is not
# counted -- what is reported is the machine's work after the click.
7400 move 233 301
7900 down
8100 up
8300 mark X
20000 mark C_DONE
24000 pause
